  "description": "Every year in October, Mexico celebrates the “Day of the Dead” — a day when the dead are allowed to reunite with their families.\nBut what if not only loved ones returned on that day… but also creatures that should have stayed buried forever?\n\nThe grim reaper itself assembles a team of the greatest warriors in world history. Together, these legendary fighters must prevent an army of the undead from overwhelming the world.\nThe battle against the underworld has begun.\nAnd it starts in Mexico.\n\n*Source: Drawing like a Sir*",
